The detection engine is a TypeScript port of EuroPII Guard
(https://github.com/sinceaihq/europii-guard, Apache-2.0, Since AI ry).

Bundled in the extension and the web demo:

- libphonenumber-js (https://gitlab.com/catamphetamine/libphonenumber-js),
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2016 @catamphetamine. It contains phone number
  metadata derived from Google's libphonenumber
  (https://github.com/google/libphonenumber), Apache License 2.0.

Used only for testing, not distributed with the extension:

- python-stdnum (https://arthurdejong.org/python-stdnum/), LGPL-2.1-or-later,
  as the reference ("oracle") for the validator parity tests. No code from
  python-stdnum is included in SafePrompt.
- ProseMirror (MIT) and Quill (BSD-3-Clause) to build the replica chat pages
  for end-to-end tests.

IBAN BBAN layouts are taken from the SWIFT IBAN Registry.
